docs {
  # Customer Storefront Auth & Identity

  Thu muc nay chua cac bai kiem thu danh rieng cho Storefront API:
  - Dang ky dinh danh xac thuc (Auth Identity)
  - Tao ho so khach hang gan voi Auth Identity
  - Dang nhap cap phat Customer JWT Bearer Token
  - Lay thong tin ho so ca nhan (/store/customers/me)
  - Kiem chung su ton tai song song hop le giua Guest Customer va Registered Member co cung dia chi email (PostgreSQL Partial Unique Index).
}
